[00:00.00] 作词 : John Lennon
[00:01.00] 作曲 : John Lennon
[00:39.04]Imagine there's no heaven 试想如果世界没有天堂
[00:45.03]It's easy if you try 这不过是举手之劳
[00:51.53]No hell below us 在我们的下面没有地狱
[00:58.40]Above us only sky 上面只有天空
[01:04.15]Imagine all the people 试想当所有的人
[01:09.76]Living for today 为了今天而活
[01:17.28]Imagine there's no countries 试想世界如果没有国界
[01:23.21]It isn't hard to do 这不难办到
[01:29.82]Nothing to kill or die for 没有杀戮或死亡
[01:36.30]And no religion too 也没有宗教信仰
[01:42.12]Imagine all the people 试想当所有的人
[01:47.92]Living life in peace 在和平中活着
[01:55.32]You may say that I'm a dreamer 你也许会说我只是在幻想
[02:01.78]But I'm not the only one 但不只是我这样
[02:07.65]I hope some day you'll join us 我希望某天你会加入我们
[02:14.48]And the world will be as one 那样这世界就会融为一体
[02:20.23]Imagine no possessions 试想如果人人没有财产
[02:26.85]I wonder if you can 我想你办得到
[02:32.81]No need for greed or hunger 再没有贪婪和饥荒
[02:39.27]A brotherhood of man 人人情同手足
[02:45.19]Imagine all the people 试想当所有的人
[02:51.02]Sharing all the world 分享着这世界
[02:58.59]You may say that I'm a dreamer 你也许会说我只是在幻想
[03:05.05]But I'm not the only one 但不只是我这样
[03:10.96]I hope some day you'll join us 我希望某天你会加入我们
